title: "TinyGestureSSD: Single-scale SSDLite hand-gesture detection for the ESP32-S3"
abstract: >-
  Training, export and INT8 quantization pipeline for a six-class single-hand
  gesture detector on the ESP32-S3, including released PyTorch checkpoints,
  ONNX graphs and ESP-DL .espdl models.
